# Single-point calculation for an atom-displaced H2O geometry
SystemName   H2O sample_0001
SystemLabel  sample_0001
NumberOfSpecies  2
NumberOfAtoms    3
%block ChemicalSpeciesLabel
 1   8  O
 2   1  H
%endblock ChemicalSpeciesLabel
LatticeConstant  1.0 Ang
%block LatticeVectors
